# @name adminTestLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

###
@adminTestToken = {{adminTestLogin.response.body.data.token}}
@adminTestId = {{adminTestLogin.response.body.data.user.id}}

### Verify existing admin role returned
