Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newclient@test.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "firstName": "New",
  "lastName": "Client",
  "phone": "+1234567890"
}

###
@newClientToken = {{clientSignup.response.body.data.token}}
@newClientId = {{clientSignup.response.body.data.user.id}}

### Verify signup token works (/me) - expected 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{newClientToken}}

### Verify signup user role is CLIENT - expected 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{newClientToken}}

